#. Description of the plugin
#: soapbox-for-blygger.php
msgid "Publishes your posts as a blyg: stable ids, versions, pins and a feed that other clients can subscribe to and quote. An independent implementation of the Blygger protocol; not affiliated with the Blygger project."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: soapbox-for-blygger.php
msgid "Robert Peake"
msgstr "Robert Peake"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: soapbox-for-blygger.php
msgid "https://www.robertpeake.com/"
msgstr "https://www.robertpeake.com/"

#: soapbox-for-blygger.php:32
msgid "Soapbox Blyg and Soapbox for Blygger are both active. They are the same plugin under its earlier and its present name, and only one of them is running. Deactivate Soapbox Blyg: Soapbox for Blygger then takes over, with the same blyg at the same addresses."
msgstr ""

